India State and District Lookup Data

The state and district names in india_states_districts.json are adapted from
OpenStreetMap-derived district data distributed with vardhan-maps 0.19.0.
The source is available at https://www.npmjs.com/package/vardhan-maps.

The data subset has been modified: boundary geometry was omitted, duplicate
names were removed, district names were sorted, Ladakh was limited to Kargil
and Leh, and Mahe and Yanam were added for Puducherry.

